UnitCLPool::Swap_beforeSwapAndAfterSwap_zeroForOne
└── when hook uses beforeSwap and afterSwap
    └── when pool is unlocked
        └── when liquidity is positive
            └── when swap is zeroForOne
                └── when sqrtPriceLimit is valid
                    ├── when swap is exactInput
                    │   ├── it calls swapHook.beforeSwap
                    │   ├── it computes feeAmount using beforeSwap fee
                    │   ├── it splits feeAmount between staked and non-staked LPs
                    │   ├── it sets feeGrowthGlobal0x128 to state.feeGrowthGlobalX128
                    │   ├── it calls swapHook.afterSwap
                    │   ├── it decreases amountCalculated by after-swap fee amount
                    │   ├── it adds after-swap gaugeFee to gaugeFees.token1
                    │   ├── it adds gaugeFee to gaugeFees.token0
                    │   ├── it computes amount0 as diff between specified and remaining amounts
                    │   ├── it sets amount1 as amountCalculated
                    │   ├── it transfers token1 with amount1 to the recipient
                    │   ├── it calls uniswapV3SwapCallback on msg.sender
                    │   └── it emits Swap event
                    └── when swap is exactOutput
                        ├── it calls swapHook.beforeSwap
                        ├── it computes feeAmount using beforeSwap fee
                        ├── it splits feeAmount between staked and non-staked LPs
                        ├── it sets feeGrowthGlobal0x128 to state.feeGrowthGlobalX128
                        ├── it calls swapHook.afterSwap
                        ├── it increases amountCalculated by after-swap fee amount
                        ├── it adds after-swap gaugeFee to gaugeFees.token0
                        ├── it adds gaugeFee to gaugeFees.token0
                        ├── it sets amount0 as amountCalculated
                        ├── it computes amount1 as diff between specified and remaining amounts
                        ├── it transfers token1 with amount1 to the recipient
                        ├── it calls uniswapV3SwapCallback on msg.sender
                        └── it emits Swap event
